# Copy to .env.local for development, and set the same two values as
# Environment Variables in your host (Vercel → Settings → Environment
# Variables) for production.
#
# Leave them unset and the app still works — local-first, offline, with
# the sync card explaining how to switch it on. Nothing breaks.
#
# Both values are safe in a client bundle: the anon key is designed to be
# public, and row-level security is what actually protects the data.
# NEVER put the service_role key here — it bypasses RLS entirely.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
